# NOTES PER TASK — V1

The purpose of this feature is simple:

I want to be able to write a short personal note (usually 2–3 lines) for any study task while studying or completing it, and later open that task and read the note for revision.

This is NOT a revision system yet.
Do NOT implement spaced repetition, revision scheduling, reminders, flashcards, AI summaries, or any other revision functionality.

The note is simply a persistent personal memory attached to a task.

